This is how a new era of comprehensive national revival was pioneered.
A new history of socialist rural construction(１)
A new history of socialist rural construction unfolded by the Workers' Party of Korea, This is a proud and surprising incident that the Workers' Party of Korea, whose greatest wish is to quickly end the post-century past of rural areas and allow all the people of the country to enjoy a prosperous and civilized life, came up with it during the 8th term of the Party Central Committee..
In the struggle to realize the new era rural revolutionary program proposed by the party over the past five years, agricultural workers have grown day by day into communists with Juche ideology, and the country's grain production structure and farming methods have also changed significantly..The material and technological foundation for continuously increasing agricultural production has been strengthened, rapid growth has been achieved in grain production, and rural areas across the country have become Seongyeong Village., Years have changed in a strange world, and new life has occurred everywhere in Beolbang and Dume Mountain Valley., The joy of a new civilization is overflowing.
The miraculous achievements made during the 8th term of the Party Central Committee, which unconditionally and stubbornly carried out the historic tasks of rural revolution that no other country could dare to tackle along the path set forth in the Socialist Rural Revolution Program, are the shining fruits of the excellent leadership of the respected Comrade General Secretary and the logo of devotion to the people..
The great new history of socialist rural construction will unfold even more majestically under the holy leadership of the Workers' Party of Korea, which is perfectly implementing the grand plan to transform all of our rural areas into a socialist paradise that we can be proud of..
Our party’s firm will-New Era Rural Revolutionary Platform Please brighten the bright future of rural development.
The 8th term of the Party Central Committee, which boldly overcame the hardships encountered under the energetic leadership of our dear Comrade General Secretary and ushered in a new era of comprehensive national revival, is sprinkling light on the socialist land with turbulent days and months that dazzlingly engraved great events and noble achievements that astonished the people of the world..
The reason why our people are able to steadily unfold a new history of century-old change that was unimaginable in the past in rural areas, which were synonymous with backwardness even in such an unruly situation, is because of our Party's new era rural revolutionary program, which reveals the quickest shortcut to a future where rural areas prosper..
Dear Comrade Kim Jong-un said the following:.
《The New Era Rural Revolutionary Platform clearly sets out the path to finally resolve rural issues and achieve complete socialist victory as soon as possible..》
The grandiose feat of the rural revolution, which erases the backwardness and backwardness of rural areas that have remained a burden on national development for a long time and writes a new history at the dawn of time, is not something that anyone can accomplish..It cherishes the realization of the dreams and ideals of the people of the whole country as its long-cherished wish and pursues endless exploration and extraordinary speculation., It is a historic cause that can only be accomplished by an outstanding politician who brightens the future through dedicated practice and powerfully organizes and mobilizes the people..
Dear Comrade General Secretary, who put forward the rural revolution as an earthly task that our generation must take on and carry out for future generations, and put endless effort into opening up a new phase in which rural areas can develop dramatically. , In the year that marked the 50th anniversary of the presentation of the Socialist Rural Thesis, he already said that a new turn must be achieved in rural construction in the new century and that rural problems must be finally resolved, and he taught us one by one the direction and methods for implementing it. At some point, while looking at crops of newly bred high-yield varieties, he emphasized that he should be well aware of the global agricultural development trend and put national effort into projects to innovate the country's overall agriculture. How sublimely the world of fiery thought and passion devoted to opening a new era of our style rural development is reflected in every step of the holy revolutionary leadership..
The respected Comrade General Secretary, who has paid close attention to the solution of rural problems from the very beginning of the new era of Juche revolution, was at the historic conference venue., On the path of meaningful local guidance, The great logo that he gave for the rapid development of our style of socialist rural life by giving valuable teachings at important party meetings and whenever the opportunity arose, deeply engraves how the rural revolutionary program of the new era was prepared through a painstaking journey of pioneering..
２０２１The 4th Plenary Meeting of the 8th Central Committee of the Workers' Party of Korea held in December 2018 is engraved in the building as a historic meeting in which the rural revolutionary program of the new era was declared to open a new turning point in our style of socialist rural development..
Dear Comrade General Secretary, the struggle for comprehensive development of socialism is a mature demand for our revolutionary practice., He had deep insight into the current situation in rural areas and made a historic report at the plenary session. 《Let us open a great new era of our own style of socialist rural development.》 He presented a new era rural revolutionary platform to brilliantly realize our party's rural construction plan..
Fundamental Purpose of the New Era Rural Revolution Program, The basic content is to ultimately solve the peasant problem and the agricultural problem, thereby helping the working class and the peasants., The goal is to completely eliminate the differences between urban and rural areas and build the people's ideal society..
In the new era rural revolution program, 《Toward a new victory in socialist rural construction!》The noble guidelines set forth in opening a great new era in which the country's agriculture will be raised to a solid upward stage and the rapid development of our style socialist rural areas will be achieved, holding high the slogan:, It is specifically revealed.
In his report to the plenary session, the respected Comrade General Secretary said that our Party's goal of socialist rural construction is to transform the entire country's rural areas into Juche ideology and make them materially wealthy, and to raise the level of ideological awareness of agricultural workers., Dramatic development of agricultural productivity, He revealed that fundamental change in the rural living environment is the goal that must be achieved in our style of rural development..
The basic task of the rural revolution in the new era is to vigorously carry out the three major revolutions, prepare all agricultural workers to become rural revolutionaries, achieve continuous growth in agricultural production, and change the aspect and environment of rural areas..
Thoughts in rural areas, technology, The problem of vigorously promoting the three major cultural revolutions, The problem of continuously growing the country's agricultural production, Problems with increasing national investment in agriculture, The problem of decisively changing the aspect and environment of rural areas, The new rural revolutionary program, which provides scientific and complete answers to all theoretical and practical problems arising in socialist rural construction in the new era, including the problem of strengthening party leadership in socialist rural construction, is a monumental document with great transformative significance in stoking the flames of rural revolution, accelerating the all-round revival of socialism, and realizing our people's century-old dream as soon as possible..
The rural revolutionary program for the new era presented by the respected Comrade General Secretary is a revolutionary continuation of the socialist rural thesis presented by the great leader and a deepening development to a new, higher level..
The new era rural revolutionary program presented at the 4th plenary session of the 8th Party Central Committee successfully tackles the serious and multifaceted difficult and vast tasks of rural development in our country without the slightest bias., It is a powerful practical weapon that can be realized in the shortest possible time..It is an immortal outline of socialist rural construction that specifies the most accurate course for ultimately resolving rural problems in response to the demands of the comprehensive development period of socialist construction, and is the banner of struggle that guarantees the victorious advance of the great new era of our style of socialist rural development..
A rural revolutionary program for a new era in which the extraordinary ideological and theoretical foresight of our dear Comrade General Secretary shines, his noble sense of responsibility for the Party and the revolution and his sense of historical mission run high, and he is overflowing with infinite love and extraordinary passion for his country and people., Here, the noble intention and unyielding will of the dear Comrade General Secretary to vigorously push forward the rural revolution and transform all our rural areas into a socialist paradise that we can be proud of and to turn the people's century-old longings and ideals into reality..
The culmination of the fiery effort and endless thought of our dear Comrade General Secretary, who devoted his whole life to transforming our rural areas into socialist ideal villages, glorifying the socialist rural construction achievements of the great leader and the great general, and who care so much to ensure that our people enjoy a prosperous and civilized life to the fullest, worthy of envy in the world, is the rural revolutionary program of the new era, and a new history of socialist rural construction begins, supported by that passionate wish. A new era of comprehensive national revival has begun..
Truly, how great is the birth itself of our party's new rural revolutionary program, how grand are the implementation process and results, and how bright will the future of socialist rural areas that this immortal outline bring?.
Headquarters Reporter Kim Jun-hyuk
